Eyebees widget is a tool for bloggers and site-owners..

== Description ==

Eyebees widget is a tool for bloggers and site-owners.It lets the current visitors of any site see each other, chat and 
interact. each bee represents a visitor,click on a bee and jump to it's location or click on a name and chat. 
groups of bees are on the same page, connect with them and know the buzz.  Requires PHP5 and Javascript enabled browsers.

== Installation ==

1. Register and create your eyebees at http://www.eyebees.com
2. Verify that you have PHP5, which is required for this plugin.
3. Upload the whole `eyebees-swarming-widget` directory to the `/wp-content/plugins/` directory
4. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' menu in WordPress
5. Configure your eyebees widget by entering your swarmcode and swarmcode type can be either dynamic or static

== Frequently Asked Questions ==

= What is Eyebees ? =

Eyebees let you see your visitor and have them see each other
greet each other by starting a chat.

= Why use Eyebees ? =
Eyebees broadcasts the current visitors of your site at once,and let people interact like
in any other social space.





